  "body_html": "<h1>ge_iff_simplex_ge</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem ge_iff_simplex_ge {f : I → 𝕜} {v : 𝕜} : (∀ i, v ≤ f i) ↔ ∀ x : stdSimplex 𝕜 I, v ≤ wsum x f</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>wsum_const</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n<li>wsum_le_wsum</li>\n<li>stdSimplex.pure</li>\n<li>Lottery.pure</li>\n</ul>",
